"team.chooseTitle":`Are you the Head of Counselling or a counsellor?`,"team.chooseBody":`The Head sees each counsellor's caseload and sends comments and requests. Each counsellor chooses what the Head sees. Your own students and cases are never mixed with the team's.`,"team.iAmHead":`I am the Head of Counselling`,"team.iAmMember":`I am a counsellor in the team`,"team.yourName":`Your name in the team`,"team.yourNameHint":`The others see it. It is also the name on your reports.`,"team.nameNeeded":`Write your name first.`,"team.roleTaken":`Leave the team on this phone first.`,"team.headCode":`The Head's code`,"team.headCodeHint":`Only the Head of Counselling has it.`,"team.headCodeWrong":`That is not the Head's code.`,"team.headCodeConfirm":`Confirm: I am the Head of Counselling`,"team.sync.title":`Sync`,"team.sync.boxAddress":`Box address`,"team.sync.boxHint":`The address shown in the sync box's window, for example 192.168.1.50 (or 192.168.1.50:9443 when the box shows a port). Leave it empty to use files only.`,"team.sync.test":`Test the box`,"team.sync.checkOk":`The box answered.`,"team.sync.checkCertificate":`The box was found, but this phone does not trust its certificate yet. Open the box's set-up page, download the certificate and install it as a CA certificate in the phone's settings. The app must also be the new installer that came with Team.`,"team.sync.checkNotBox":`Something answered at that address, but it is not the sync box. Check the address and the port.`,"team.sync.checkUnreachable":`The box did not answer. Check: this phone is on the school Wi-Fi; the box's window is open; the address is the one in that window, with its port if it shows one; the firewall file was run on the box's computer.`,"team.sync.checkUnreachableWeb":`The box did not answer. Check: this device is on the school network; the box's window is open; the address is the one in that window, with its port if it shows one; the firewall file was run on the box's computer; the box's certificate is installed and trusted on this device; and, if the browser asked to reach devices on your local network, that you allowed it.`,"team.sync.checkBlocked":`This browser does not let the app reach devices on the school network: a browser setting or a school policy blocks it. Click the icon at the left of the address bar → Site settings → Local network access → Allow, then reload the app. If that setting is missing or locked, ask IT to allow https://johnkitch.github.io in the browser policy LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls.`,"team.sync.checkPrompt":`The browser has not been allowed to let the app reach devices on the school network. When it asks, choose Allow, then test the box again. If it never asks, click the icon at the left of the address bar → Site settings → Local network access → Allow.`,"team.sync.directHint":`Direct test: open the box in a new tab. If it shows {"app":"imperial-counselling-sync-box","v":1} with no warning, the box and its certificate are fine, and this browser or a school policy keeps the app from reaching the school network (Site settings → Local network access → Allow; or IT allows https://johnkitch.github.io in the policy LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls). A warning means the certificate; nothing at all means the network, the firewall or the address.`,"team.sync.directOpen":`Open the box in a new tab`,"team.sync.badAddress":`That is not a box address. Type it as the box shows it, for example 192.168.1.50.`,"team.sync.saveAddress":`Save address`,"team.sync.addressSaved":`Address saved.`,"team.sync.now":`Sync now`,"team.sync.running":`Syncing…`,"team.sync.never":`Not synced with the box yet.`,"team.sync.last":`Last sync: {when}`,"team.sync.lastFailed":`Last try {when}: the box could not be reached.`,"team.sync.done":`Synced.`,"team.sync.unreachable":`Could not reach the box. Check that this phone is on the school Wi-Fi and that the box is running.`,"team.sync.failed":`The box did not take the update. Try again.`,"team.sync.noBox":`No box address yet. Use files, or type the box address.`,"team.sync.filesTitle":`By file`,"team.sync.filesHint":`For when the box cannot be used. The file is locked: only the other phone can open it. Pass it with Quick Share, AirDrop, a cable or e-mail.`,"team.sync.sendFile":`Send by file`,"team.sync.openFile":`Open a file`,"team.file.made":`File made.`,"team.file.applied":`Update from {name} taken in.`,"team.file.old":`This file is older than what is already here. Nothing changed.`,"team.file.notAPack":`This is not a team file.`,"team.file.notForThisPhone":`This file is meant for the other phone.`,"team.file.unknown":`This file is from a phone that is not paired with this one.`,"team.file.damaged":`This file cannot be opened. Ask for a new one.`,"team.file.invite":`This is a pairing file. Open it from "Add a counsellor".`,"team.head.members":`Your team`,"team.head.noMembersTitle":`No counsellors yet`,"team.head.noMembersBody":`Ask each counsellor to choose "I am a counsellor in the team" and give you the code their phone shows.`,"team.head.add":`Add a counsellor`,"team.head.asOf":`As of {when}`,"team.head.nothingYet":`No update from them yet`,"team.count.active":`{n} open`,"team.count.waiting":`{n} pending`,"team.count.red":`{n} Red`,"team.count.consent":`Consent missing: {n}`,"team.count.overdue":`{n} overdue reminders`,"team.count.open":`{n} open`,"team.waiting.title":`Waiting for`,"team.waiting.none":`Nothing you are waiting for.`,"team.promised.title":`I promised`,"team.promised.none":`No promises open.`,"team.due":`Due {when}`,"team.overdue":`Overdue · {when}`,"team.leave.head":`Stop being the Head on this phone`,"team.leave.member":`Leave the team`,"team.leave.confirm":`Remove every paired phone and the team records from this phone? Your own students and cases are not touched.`,"team.add.title":`Add a counsellor`,"team.add.steps":`On the counsellor's phone: More → Team → "I am a counsellor in the team" → Pair with the Head. Their phone shows a code.`,"team.add.code"